          "heading": "How we started",
          "html": "<p><em>Sample text — replace me:</em> {{guild_name}} started because the regular guild kept saying tiny work was a phase. It was not. We sew small because the math is the pleasure. A bed quilt here is a year, and we are not sorry.</p>",
