          "heading": "The number",
          "html": "<p><em>Sample text — replace me:</em> We sew 1.5-inch cut squares to finish at one inch. If you want 0.75 finished, that is a private dare. In this room the inch is the inch so we can trade blocks without a calculator.</p>",
